cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "PRISM: A Physics-Reality Integrated Signal Multistream Framework for Explainable Deepfake Detection Using Handcrafted Forensic Features"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, frozen evaluation protocol and per-video results for PRISM-50,
  a 50-descriptor handcrafted forensic representation for video deepfake detection.
  Includes the identity-disjoint FaceForensics++ split, the frozen LightGBM configuration,
  the substrate operating-domain checker, and the per-video scores behind every reported table.
